# Used only by `npm run build:offline` (Vite's --mode offline), never by the Docker/nginx build
# or the SaaS desktop build. Points at the bundled .NET sidecar's fixed loopback port (see
# backend/src/ShopKeeper.Api.Local/Program.cs) rather than the hosted API - there is no server
# for this edition at all.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:58732/api
# Read by lib/api-client.ts (withCredentials), config/navigation.ts, and SettingsPage.tsx to
# strip SaaS-only concepts (cookie-based refresh, AI Advisor, Employees, Roles, Security,
# Subscription) - see App.tsx for the top-level tree switch this also drives.
VITE_EDITION=offline
